Z||000000||Dumba$$||10-11-2001||11:33 PM||||as of 3:25 this morning i am a new father,<BR>so, chances are im gonna need to put the car seat in the fiero at some time or another,<BR>does any body have suggestions or comments on this?<BR>Ive herd that the fiero's have a ***** (5 star) front and side, saftey impact rating, that meets up to 1998 car saftey standards. is this true?<BR>did the government do these types of tests in the 1980's if so, how did the fiero rate?<BR>any comments or info is appreaciated<BR>thanks<BR><P>------------------<BR>Rich<BR>Sioux Falls SD<BR>Red 84 SE<BR>Gold 86 SE <BR>98 acura cl 3.0<P>4.9 caddy engine for sale 30,000 miles complete with bubba joes mounts!!  $850<P>if it dont go, put a fart can, and clear taillights on it!!||||reg||2
