Z||000010||theogre||10-12-2001||11:45 PM||||before buying car seats, strollers, etc, check the CPSC and NHTSA links in my cave. More recalls on child products were released just this week.<P>You'll likely need the metal clip that ties the soulder to the lap belt so you can thread it thru the seat correctly but otherwise Fiero isn't an issue. There's no air bag and plenty of room between the seat back and dash.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||4
